{%- set valid_orders = ['<domain>_<env>_<dataproduct>', '<domain>_<dataproduct>_<env>', '<env>_<domain>_<dataproduct>'] %}
{%- set order = object_component_order if object_component_order is defined and object_component_order in valid_orders else '<domain>_<dataproduct>_<env>' %}
{%- set strategy = account_strategy if account_strategy is defined else 'Single Account' %}
{%- set parts = [] %}
{%- for component in order.split('_') %}
{%- set token = component[1:-1] %}
{%- if token == 'domain' and strategy not in ['Multi-Account (Domain-based)', 'Multi-Account (Domain + Environment)'] %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_domain | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- elif token == 'env' and strategy not in ['Multi-Account (Environment-based)', 'Multi-Account (Domain + Environment)'] %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_environment | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- elif token == 'dataproduct' %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_name | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
{%- set prefix = parts | join('_') %}
## Core Roles Configuration

### Roles to Create

{%- if scim_prefix | upper != 'NONE' %}
{%- set owner_role = scim_prefix | upper ~ '_PROVISIONER' %}
{%- else %}
{%- set owner_role = 'USERADMIN' %}
{%- endif %}

| Role | Name | Purpose | Owner |
|------|------|---------|-------|
| **ADMIN** | `{{ prefix }}_ADMIN` | Owns infrastructure (databases, schemas, warehouses) | `{{ owner_role }}` |
| **CREATE** | `{{ prefix }}_CREATE` | Creates objects and manages grants | `{{ owner_role }}` |
| **WRITE** | `{{ prefix }}_WRITE` | Modifies data (DML operations) | `{{ owner_role }}` |
| **RBAC** | `{{ prefix }}_RBAC` | Owns access roles for delegated governance | `{{ owner_role }}` |
| **READ** | `{{ prefix }}_READ` | Read-only access to data product | `{{ owner_role }}` |

### Role Hierarchy

```
SYSADMIN
└── {{ prefix }}_ADMIN
    ├── {{ prefix }}_CREATE
    └── {{ prefix }}_RBAC
```

### SCIM Configuration

{%- if scim_prefix | upper != 'NONE' %}
| Setting | Value |
|---------|-------|
| **SCIM Enabled** | Yes |
| **SCIM Prefix** | `{{ scim_prefix | upper }}` |
| **Role Owner** | `{{ scim_prefix | upper }}_PROVISIONER` |
| **User Assignment** | Via identity provider groups |

> **Note:** After roles are created, configure your identity provider ({{ scim_prefix }}) to map groups to these roles for automatic user assignment.
{%- else %}
| Setting | Value |
|---------|-------|
| **SCIM Enabled** | No |
| **Role Owner** | `USERADMIN` |
| **User Assignment** | Manual GRANT statements |

> **Note:** Use `GRANT ROLE <role> TO USER <user>` to assign users to these roles.
{%- endif %}

### Account Access Roles

No account access roles are granted in this step. The following `<prefix>_AR_*` account access roles are created and granted in the later hierarchy step:

| Access Role | Purpose |
|-------------|---------|
| `<prefix>_AR_EXEC_TASK` | Execute Snowflake tasks (scheduled jobs) |
| `<prefix>_AR_VIEW_AUSG` | View Account Usage data for monitoring |
| `<prefix>_AR_APPLY_DDM` | Apply dynamic data masking policies |
| `<prefix>_AR_APPLY_RAP` | Apply row access policies |
| `<prefix>_AR_APPLY_TAG` | Apply tags to objects |
